                <pb facs="0897" n="777" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg777"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Eddy to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-31"><hi rendition="#italic">October 31,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>New cabinet contains following changes: Minister of the interior, Alexis
                    Obolensky; minister of finance, Romaroff; minister of justice, Koni; minister of
                    education, Krosovsky; minister of ways and communications, Ziegler Von
                    Sgaffhausen.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eddy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
